In this project, I implemented a Square Star Pattern program using C++.
* Used nested loops to generate the pattern.
* Printed stars in a square shape with equal rows and columns.
* Controlled the number of rows and columns using a variable.
* Practiced loop concepts and iteration techniques.
* Improved understanding of pattern printing logic.
* Learned how nested loops work together to create structured outputs.
* Tested the program to ensure the pattern was displayed correctly.
This project helped me strengthen my understanding of loops, nested loops, and basic pattern programming concepts in C++.
